# THE APPLICANT PROFILE. Real name, email, phone, home address, postcode,
# LinkedIn and a path to a CV — the densest piece of personal data in this
# repository, and the one most likely to be created in a hurry.
#
# applicant.example.json has told people to "copy to applicant.json
# (gitignored)" since it was written. That was not true until 2026-08-02: the
# ignore rule did not exist, so the claim was a promise the repo did not keep.
# Nothing had leaked — no applicant.json was ever tracked — but only because
# nobody had run the command the docs asked for.
applicant.json
applicant.*.json
!applicant.example.json
